# Q: does the Berlin chapter's first mission play, and is it won only by the command centre?
#
#   MiVic.Game.exe --mission b1_vistula --probe tools/probe/b1-vistula.probe --probe-out artifacts/probe/b1-vistula.txt
#
# The regression this mission was written against: m1 used to be decided in seconds by any
# structure the ally's AI happened to kill. b1 has no ally, and its objective names the
# command centre, so the first thousand ticks belong to the war and not to the ledger. The
# second half is the war itself: the whole starting force is sent at the command centre,
# which is the only way this mission is allowed to end.

objectives
teams
tick 1000
objectives
expect "the war is still on a thousand ticks in" 1.0 1.0 0.0

# The assault: everything mobile, at the command centre (structures 2 names its slot).
structures 2
order 4 attack 18
order 5 attack 18
order 6 attack 18
order 7 attack 18
order 8 attack 18
order 9 attack 18
order 10 attack 18
order 11 attack 18
order 12 attack 18
order 13 attack 18
order 14 attack 18
tick 9000
objectives
teams
